# Restriction checkboxes for TSX_EssentialAuth_v1.tt (see Docs/Reference.md section 3).
# The sign-in of a React app: no table and no database, only the project settings. Auth=true in the project turns the group on; or run it from the Essentials menu or `codegen essentials`.
Scope=None
Stacks=React
EssentialsGroup=Auth
EssentialsDefault=false
Description=api/auth.ts, pages/LoginPage.tsx and components/RequireAuth.tsx: the session, the sign-in page and the route guard (Auth=true); needs POST api/auth/login and the Support group
